<svelte:head><title>About our hub — beVisioneers Harare Hub</title><meta name="description" content="Get to know beVisioneers Harare Hub, a local community of young people working on environmental ideas and climate solutions."/></svelte:head>
<section class="page-hero turquoise"><p class="eyebrow">ROOTED IN HARARE. CONNECTED TO THE WORLD.</p><h1>A local community.<br/>A shared vision.<span class="heading-star" aria-hidden="true">✳</span></h1><p>Bringing young environmental innovators together<br class="desktop-break"/> to connect, create, and grow.</p></section>
<section class="section intro-section"><p class="eyebrow">WHO WE ARE</p><div><h2>Big possibilities<br/>begin with people.</h2><p class="large-copy">BeVisioneers Harare Hub is a local chapter of the global beVisioneers fellowship community. We bring together fellows working across climate impact zones to learn from one another and build connections around their ideas.</p><p>Our chapter website puts those people and their work in the spotlight. It helps communities, businesses, and collaborators discover our fellows and find ways to support their growth.</p></div></section>
<section class="section about-community-feature"><figure class="about-community-photo"><img src="/images/local/harare-fellows-1600.webp" srcset="/images/local/harare-fellows-640.webp 640w, /images/local/harare-fellows-1000.webp 1000w, /images/local/harare-fellows-1600.webp 1600w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) calc(100vw - 44px), 48vw" width="1600" height="1200" alt="Harare Hub fellows gathered on a lawn beneath the trees, smiling for a group portrait" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>Our local community, together in Harare.</figcaption></figure><div class="about-community-copy"><p class="eyebrow">OUR PEOPLE, TOGETHER</p><h2>A community<br/>to grow with.</h2><p>Behind every idea is a person. Our hub brings fellows together to share experiences, learn from one another, and make connections that help their work grow.</p><p>Different climate interests. Different journeys. A shared place to belong.</p><a class="button outline" href="/fellows">Get to know our fellows <span>&nearr;</span></a></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">WHAT BRINGS US TOGETHER</p><h2>Ideas grow<br/>through connection.</h2></div></div><div class="values-grid"><div class="yellow"><span>01 / DISCOVER</span><h3>Make local talent visible.</h3><p>Give fellows a place to share their climate focus, project stories, products, and services as their work develops.</p></div><div class="purple"><span>02 / CONNECT</span><h3>Open the door to possibility.</h3><p>Help people find fellows to collaborate with, buy from, mentor, or support.</p></div><div class="orange"><span>03 / GROW</span><h3>Move forward together.</h3><p>Share events, opportunities, knowledge, and news that help our chapter and its fellows grow.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section global-section"><p class="eyebrow">PART OF SOMETHING BIGGER</p><div><h2>Local roots.<br/>Global community.</h2><p class="large-copy">The global beVisioneers fellowship equips young environmental innovators with training, expert support, and resources to develop their solutions.</p><p>The fellowship is implemented by The DO School Fellowships gGmbH and supported by Mercedes-Benz.</p><a class="button dark" href="https://bevisioneers.world/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Explore the global fellowship <span>↗</span></a></div></section>
